# An accessor-backed property crossing a package boundary: the library declares
# the interface and does the reads/writes, but only the consumer ever sees an
# accessor implementation. The library's module must still emit the accessor
# branch — "no `get area` in this module" is not "no accessor in the program".
# name           dir  deps           root
@test/shape      lib  -
main             app  @test/shape    root
